    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.0,
      468.32,
      540.19,
      514.4
    ],
    "text": "I, Maithree Gunarathna, The Governor of Central Province impose the following regulations on the payment of fuel allowancefor Members of the Urban Council, made as per the powers vested on me by Section 193 (g) of the Municipal CouncilOrdinance which is the 255th rule to be read with clause 2 (1) (a) of Provincial Councils Act, (Consequential Provisions)No. 12 of 1989. These regulations shall be effective from 15.03.2019.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      436.08,
      533.12,
      529.8,
      543.2
    ],
    "text": "MAITHREE GUNARATHNE,",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.959303855895996,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.0,
      545.12,
      517.53,
      603.2
    ],
    "text": "Governor,Central Province.On 15th, March, 2019,At Governor\u2019s Secretariat,Central Province.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      268.8,
      616.44,
      319.04,
      626.52
    ],
    "text": "Regulations",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      57.84,
      638.0,
      524.5,
      648.08
    ],
    "text": "01. These regulations may be cited as the regulations on payment of fuel allowance for Members of Urban Council.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      57.84,
      656.71,
      540.23,
      666.8
    ],
    "text": "02. These allowances are in addition to the allowances stated in the extraordinary Gazette No. 1914/40 of 15.05.2015 of the",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      76.08,
      668.72,
      539.76,
      690.8
    ],
    "text": "Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka. A fuel allowance may be paid to the Members of the Urban Council by theirrelevant Urban Council funds as follows.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      66.72,
      72.27,
      535.08,
      92.68
    ],
    "text": "IV (w) jeks fldgi \u2014 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'08'06PART IV(A) \u2014 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 06.08.20192 A",
    "fonts": [
      "FMAbabldBold",
