    "bbox": [
      182.88,
      735.65,
      421.5,
      742.61
    ],
    "text": "PRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.959303855895996
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.2,
      108.08,
      446.55,
      118.16
    ],
    "text": "Payment of fuel allowance of Rs. 2,500 for the Members of the Urban Council of Central Province.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      78.0,
      130.88,
      363.95,
      140.96
    ],
    "text": "*This allowance is valid only for the Members of the Urban Council.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      78.0,
      153.68,
      546.99,
      163.75
    ],
    "text": "*The Chairman/Deputy Chairman shall receive this allowance it he\u2019s not receiving such at the moment. One person",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      97.2,
      165.68,
      296.49,
      175.75
    ],
    "text": "is not entiled for two allowances for one purpose.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      78.0,
      188.48,
      266.46,
      198.55
    ],
    "text": "*This is not relevant to Municipal Councils.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      78.0,
      211.28,
      546.96,
      221.36
    ],
    "text": "*Maximum limit for each member is Rs. 2,500/- if one does not own a motor cycle/Three wheeler or other motor",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      97.2,
      223.28,
      547.17,
      245.36
    ],
    "text": "vehicle, one may use any other vehicle and shall produce bills or documents. One may obtain relevant runningcharts.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      78.0,
      259.28,
      465.9,
      269.36
    ],
    "text": "*One may produce details of running for council duties and monitoring development works.",
